## 7. Backlink Strategy

### 7.1 Local Backlinks (High Priority)
- [ ] **Partner with Sri Lankan health blogs** for guest posts
- [ ] **Get featured in Sri Lankan news outlets**:
  - Daily Mirror, Sunday Times, Daily FT, Economy Next, Roar.lk
- [ ] **Collaborate with Sri Lankan health influencers** on Instagram/YouTube
- [ ] **Sponsor local health events** (Colombo Marathon, health expos)
- [ ] **Submit press releases** to Sri Lankan PR distribution services
- [ ] **Partner with Sri Lankan pharmacies** for mutual linking

### 7.2 Industry Backlinks
- [ ] **Get listed on telehealth aggregators/comparison sites**
- [ ] **Contribute expert opinions to health publications**
- [ ] **Create linkable assets** — infographics, statistics pages ("Men's Health Stats in Sri Lanka")
- [ ] **HARO (Help a Reporter Out)** — respond to health-related journalist queries

### 7.3 Digital PR
- [ ] **Create a "Sri Lanka Men's Health Report"** — shareable research content
- [ ] **Develop free tools** — "Hair Loss Assessment Quiz" (already have QuizCTA — optimize this for backlinks)

