## 9. Reviews & Reputation Management

- [ ] **Actively solicit Google reviews** from satisfied patients (post-consultation email)
- [ ] **Make it easy to leave a review** — Short link on website, WhatsApp auto-message
- [ ] **Display reviews/testimonials on website** with structured data
- [ ] **Respond to every review** — positive and negative
- [ ] **Target 50+ Google reviews in first 6 months** (competitive benchmark for SL)
- [ ] **Encourage reviews on Facebook** as well (secondary signal)

