## 10. Analytics & Monitoring

- [ ] **Google Search Console** — Set up and monitor weekly
- [ ] **Google Analytics 4** — Install and configure conversion tracking
- [ ] **Track key events**:
  - Consultation bookings
  - Product page views
  - Blog engagement (scroll depth, time on page)
  - Quiz completions
- [ ] **Set up rank tracking** — Monitor positions for target keywords (Ahrefs, SEMrush, or free: Google Search Console)
- [ ] **Monitor Core Web Vitals** monthly
- [ ] **Set up Google Alerts** for brand name "ADAM" + "men's health Sri Lanka"
- [ ] **Monthly SEO audit** — Check for broken links, crawl errors, new opportunities

