> [!NOTE]
> **Estimated timeline to see results**: Local SEO in Sri Lanka is less competitive than Western markets. With consistent effort, expect to see movement in **3–4 months** and meaningful traffic growth in **6–8 months**. Blog content targeting long-tail Sri Lankan queries can rank within **2–4 weeks** due to low competition.
